---
// BeP09 figure: BeP09OverrideLeak
---
<figure class="bep9n3">
  <div class="bep9n3-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 310" role="img" aria-label="Two timelines with test A followed by test B. Without cleanup, the override set in test A stays set and test B runs with it. With cleanup after yield, the override is cleared when test A ends, even if A fails, and test B starts clean.">
    <text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>app.dependency_overrides, test after test</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>app.dependency_overrides, hết test này tới test khác</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="104" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>no cleanup</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không cleanup</tspan></text>
    <rect x="250" y="70" width="280" height="44" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="390" y="97" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>test A</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>test A</tspan></text>
    <rect x="550" y="70" width="310" height="44" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="705" y="97" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>test B</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>test B</tspan></text>
    <rect x="290" y="126" width="570" height="12" rx="6" class="redbar" />
    <text x="290" y="162" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>override set in test A, never cleared</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>override được đặt ở test A, không bao giờ gỡ</tspan></text>
    <text x="860" y="162" text-anchor="end" class="redt"><tspan data-lang-en>test B still runs with it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>test B vẫn chạy cùng nó</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="224" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>cleanup after yield</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cleanup sau yield</tspan></text>
    <rect x="250" y="190" width="280" height="44" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="390" y="217" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>test A</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>test A</tspan></text>
    <rect x="550" y="190" width="310" height="44" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="705" y="217" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>test B</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>test B</tspan></text>
    <rect x="290" y="246" width="190" height="12" rx="6" class="bar" />
    <line x1="490" y1="240" x2="490" y2="264" class="ln" />
    <text x="290" y="282" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>set in test A</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>được đặt ở test A</tspan></text>
    <text x="490" y="282" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>cleared when A ends</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>được gỡ khi A xong</tspan></text>
    <text x="860" y="282" text-anchor="end" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>test B starts clean</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>test B bắt đầu sạch</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The override lives on the shared app object, not on the test, so it outlives the test that set it unless a fixture clears it.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Override nằm trên object app dùng chung chứ không nằm trong test, nên nó sống lâu hơn test đã đặt nó, trừ khi một fixture gỡ nó đi.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
